{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00887","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 有所思 · 卢仝","name":"鼓吹曲辞 有所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当时我醉美人家，美人颜色娇如花。\n今日美人弃我去，青楼珠箔天之涯。\n天涯娟娟常娥月，三五二八盈又缺。\n翠眉蝉鬓生别离，一望不见心断绝。\n心断绝，几千里，梦中醉卧巫山云。\n觉来泪滴湘江水，湘江两岸花木深。\n美人不见愁人心，含愁更奏绿绮琴，调高弦绝无知音。\n美人兮美人！不知爲暮雨兮爲朝云。\n相思一夜梅花发，忽到窗前疑是君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}